KEDR is a Go reimplementation of the core command-line behavior and resource
recommendation algorithms from Robusta KRR (https://github.com/robusta-dev/krr),
used under the MIT License. The compatibility baseline is KRR commit d1ccf01.

KEDR is not Robusta SaaS and does not include Robusta's web UI, HolmesGPT,
publishing integrations, enforcer, or Helm chart.
